<title>USA: High Plains Wheat - Basis bids mostly unchanged.</title>
<headline>High Plains Wheat - Basis bids mostly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basis bids for hard red winter wheat were mostly unchanged, grain merchandisers in the U.S. High Plains said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, dealers reported mixed levels of farmer sales of HRW wheat. A dealer in south-central Kansas said farmer sales were strong, while dealers in Oklahoma said sales were slow.</p>
<p>&quot;Yesterday was another big day volume-wise,&quot; the Kansas dealer said. &quot;This has been our biggest week since the middle of harvest.&quot;  </p>
